  "contentHtml": "<p>10월15일에 교내 환경공모전을 2시간 동안 실시하였습니다.</p><p>(환경이모티콘, 독후감, 일러스트, 사진전, 콜라주포스터, 정크아트, ucc부문)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/66cc420cbe3c6d553153f922ec434318e2e8e502\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/66cc420cbe3c6d553153f922ec434318e2e8e502\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0d5417db63310ee32f47a52304f621e7bec481f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0d5417db63310ee32f47a52304f621e7bec481f\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p>기후위기, 환경실천을 전달하는 메세지를 담은 내용을 다양한 부문에서 행사에 참여할 수 있도록 기획하였습니다.</p><p>그리고 환경과학동아리에서 업사이클링 무드등 체험부스를 점심시간에 운영하여 인기폭발 하였습니다~^^</p><p>환경공모전 계획서 원하시는 선생님은 저에게 <b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">atp6598@naver.com</span> </b>메일 보내 주시면 답장 드리겠습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d183daaae7d06feeb4d8f67a6521e5357e88aed9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d183daaae7d06feeb4d8f67a6521e5357e88aed9\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"1533\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3638ad355f84551c0a6a91c38095c4f933ecf66a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3638ad355f84551c0a6a91c38095c4f933ecf66a\" data-origin-width=\"1026\" data-origin-height=\"1191\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d32899a5f2e8f94032f5698f2a083496ba0f848a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d32899a5f2e8f94032f5698f2a083496ba0f848a\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d96f8bc6fc0f25591d2bb97703f6736cb134c81\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d96f8bc6fc0f25591d2bb97703f6736cb134c81\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d7560d86bd75d53a5ecf40a749dbd4823aae88ec\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d7560d86bd75d53a5ecf40a749dbd4823aae88ec\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/10c0220b9db735e891c517020c1a60e1e914bf74\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/10c0220b9db735e891c517020c1a60e1e914bf74\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fe3a6fde2bc3c5b0b7577456dd11975b7e219d32\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fe3a6fde2bc3c5b0b7577456dd11975b7e219d32\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeat